										{
											"type": "code"
										}
									],
									"text": "The key concept to understand is that savedSign contains the actual image data, not just a reference to it. When a signature is saved to localStorage, it's typically converted to a text representation (base64 string) that looks something like: \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAAN...\""
